                            <comment id="16729061" author="pkouznet" created="Wed, 26 Dec 2018 15:06:15 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Also we should double check that neither _key nor _val could be null&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16742001" author="pkouznet" created="Mon, 14 Jan 2019 12:28:02 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=tledkov-gridgain&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;tledkov-gridgain&quot;&gt;tledkov-gridgain&lt;/a&gt; Patch is done, could you please do a code review?&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
