                            <comment id="16749843" author="vozerov" created="Wed, 23 Jan 2019 11:44:12 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=pkouznet&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;pkouznet&quot;&gt;pkouznet&lt;/a&gt;, unfortunately there are still unnecessary copying. There should be no copying, as all necessary info is already available. &lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16749854" author="vozerov" created="Wed, 23 Jan 2019 11:57:24 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;I was wrong, Arrays.asList doesn&apos;t copy anything. Moved back to &quot;Patch Available&quot;.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
