                            <comment id="16750842" author="vozerov" created="Thu, 24 Jan 2019 08:03:54 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=pkouznet&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;pkouznet&quot;&gt;pkouznet&lt;/a&gt;, unfortunately fix doesn&apos;t work, I reverted it. Please take a look at &lt;tt&gt;IgniteCacheUpdateSqlQuerySelfTest&lt;/tt&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;
