&lt;/ol&gt;
</comment>
                            <comment id="16751101" author="pkouznet" created="Thu, 24 Jan 2019 13:05:47 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Thank you!&lt;br/&gt;
p 2 - Yes I see, this is consequence of my &quot;fail fast&quot; changes. Fixed that.&lt;br/&gt;
Also I see that other tests that was introduced during &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-4363&quot; title=&quot;Inner properties mutation broken in SQL UPDATE&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;IGNITE-4363&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;IGNITE-4363&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt; should be fixed. Their goal is to test operations on the nested fields, but their implementation inserts entire _key/_val and updates nested field as one operation. Now I should split this operation to 2 separated operations.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
